sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor T as Trader
  participant P as Plumbline server
  participant I as NEAR Intents
  participant AG as Agent account (topmember.near)
  participant AI as NEAR AI Cloud (TEE model)
  participant OP as Operator (topmemberbuild.near)

  T->>P: Order a verdict
  Note over P: Gate: kill switch off? daily budget left?
  P->>I: Quote (not dry)
  I-->>T: Deposit address
  T->>I: Pays 0.1 NEAR
  I->>AG: Swaps and delivers USDC
  T->>P: Verdict request + order id
  P->>I: Status of this order?
  I-->>P: SUCCESS (single use, paid to the agent)
  Note over P: Rules decide ALLOW / WARN / BLOCK (checks.ts)
  P->>AI: Explain this verdict (2 sentences)
  AI-->>P: Explanation + signature
  Note over P: verifier.ts: fresh nonce, NVIDIA GPU check,<br/>signature matches the attested address
  P-->>T: Verdict + explanation + proof status
  Note over P: Everything is logged to ledger.jsonl
  Note over AG,OP: Operator runs payout.ts: owed = fees - inference cost - float - already paid
  AG->>OP: USDC share (ft_transfer, dry run by default)
